{"seq":1,"slug":"basic-paxos","title":"基本 Paxos","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consensus-algorithms-raft-paxos/paxos/basic-paxos","wordCount":2004,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"基本-paxos\">基本 Paxos</h1><p>Lamport 用一个虚构的希腊岛屿 Paxos 上「兼职议员靠传纸条立法」的寓言来讲这个协议，结果寓言喧宾夺主，让无数读者觉得它玄妙难懂。剥掉故事外壳，基本 Paxos 解决的问题朴素得不能再朴素：一群进程，每个想提议一个值，如何保证最终只有一个值被选定，且这个决定无法被推翻——即便消息任意延迟、进程随时崩溃。它的全部精巧，浓缩在两个阶段和一条「多数派必相交」的论证里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>基本 Paxos 把参与者分成三种逻辑角色(一个进程可同时扮演多个)，并通过两轮消息交换达成单值共识。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  PR[&quot;提议者 Proposer&lt;br/&gt;发起提议、推动决议&quot;] --&gt; P1[&quot;阶段1a Prepare(n)&lt;br/&gt;带提案编号n问询&quot;]&#10;  P1 --&gt; AC[&quot;接受者 Acceptor&lt;br/&gt;投票、记忆已接受值&quot;]&#10;  AC --&gt; P1B[&quot;阶段1b Promise&lt;br/&gt;承诺不再接受&lt;n的提案&lt;br/&gt;并回报已接受的值&quot;]&#10;  P1B --&gt; P2[&quot;阶段2a Accept(n,v)&lt;br/&gt;v取回报中最高编号的值&lt;br/&gt;没有则用自己的值&quot;]&#10;  P2 --&gt; AC2[&quot;接受者再投票&quot;]&#10;  AC2 --&gt; P2B[&quot;阶段2b Accepted&lt;br/&gt;多数派接受则v被选定&quot;]&#10;  P2B --&gt; LN[&quot;学习者 Learner&lt;br/&gt;获知最终决议&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  PR[\"提议者 Proposer&lt;br/&gt;发起提议、推动决议\"] --&gt; P1[\"阶段1a Prepare(n)&lt;br/&gt;带提案编号n问询\"]\n  P1 --&gt; AC[\"接受者 Acceptor&lt;br/&gt;投票、记忆已接受值\"]\n  AC --&gt; P1B[\"阶段1b Promise&lt;br/&gt;承诺不再接受&lt;n的提案&lt;br/&gt;并回报已接受的值\"]\n  P1B --&gt; P2[\"阶段2a Accept(n,v)&lt;br/&gt;v取回报中最高编号的值&lt;br/&gt;没有则用自己的值\"]\n  P2 --&gt; AC2[\"接受者再投票\"]\n  AC2 --&gt; P2B[\"阶段2b Accepted&lt;br/&gt;多数派接受则v被选定\"]\n  P2B --&gt; LN[\"学习者 Learner&lt;br/&gt;获知最终决议\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提议者 Proposer</td>\n<td>发起带编号的提案，驱动两阶段</td>\n<td>当前尝试的提案编号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接受者 Acceptor</td>\n<td>对提案投票，是协议的「记忆」</td>\n<td>已承诺的最高编号、已接受的(编号,值)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习者 Learner</td>\n<td>学习被选定的值，不参与决策</td>\n<td>学到的决议值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>接受者是整个协议的记忆中枢——它必须把「已承诺的最高编号」和「已接受的(编号,值)」持久化到磁盘，崩溃重启后不能遗忘，否则安全性会被破坏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"提案编号-全局唯一且单调\">提案编号：全局唯一且单调</h2><p>两阶段协议的一切都挂在「提案编号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>」上，所以先把它说清。每个提案有一个全局唯一、可比较大小的编号。唯一性通常这样构造：把编号做成 <code>(轮次, 提议者ID)</code> 的二元组，比较时先比轮次再比 ID，这样不同提议者绝不会撞号。单调性则要求每个提议者每发起一个新提案就用比之前都大的编号——崩溃重启后也要保证不回退(故需持久化或从接受者的回报中学习当前最高编号)。</p>\n<p>编号的作用是给提案排出一个全序，让接受者能用「只听更高编号的话」这条简单规则来仲裁竞争。当多个提议者并发抢着提议时，编号大的会逐步「压制」编号小的：接受者一旦对编号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 做了承诺，就会拒绝所有编号小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的请求。这正是 Paxos 不需要预先选主、却仍能在混乱并发中收敛的关键——编号本身就是一种隐式的、动态的优先级。注意编号大不代表值「更对」，它只决定谁有权推进，被选定的值仍由阶段 1b 的回报决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两阶段的精确语义\">两阶段的精确语义</h2><p>阶段一是「探路与抢占」。提议者选一个新编号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，向所有接受者发 <code>Prepare(n)</code>。接受者收到后做两件事：如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 大于它见过的所有编号，就承诺「今后不再接受编号小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的提案」，并把自己「已经接受过的最高编号提案的值」回报给提议者；如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 不够大，直接忽略或拒绝。提议者一旦从一个多数派收到承诺，就进入阶段二。</p>\n<p>阶段二是「提交值」。这里有 Paxos 最反直觉、也最关键的一步：提议者在阶段二要提交的值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，不一定是它自己想提的值。规则是——检查阶段一收回的所有承诺里，有没有接受者回报过「已接受的值」；如果有，必须选其中编号最高的那个值作为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>；只有当所有回报都说「我还没接受过任何值」时，提议者才能用自己的原始提议。确定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 后，向多数派发 <code>Accept(n, v)</code>，接受者只要没承诺过更高编号就接受它。一旦某个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 被一个多数派接受，它就被选定(chosen)了，决定从此不可推翻。</p>\n<p>这条「必须沿用已接受的最高编号值」的规则，就是安全性的全部秘密。它让每个后来者都被迫尊重「可能已经选定的值」，从而保证整个系统只会收敛到一个值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么只会选出一个值-多数派交集论证\">为什么只会选出一个值：多数派交集论证</h2><p>这是全 hub 最值得反复咀嚼的论证，把它讲透。假设某个值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 在编号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 下被选定了——意味着存在一个多数派 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，其中每个接受者都接受了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。现在要证明：任何编号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&#x27; &gt; n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.791em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的提案，最终提交的值也必然是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>考虑这个更高编号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的提议者。它在阶段一要收集一个多数派 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的承诺。由 <a href=\"../foundations/consensus-problem\">共识问题</a> 里的多数派相交性质，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必有至少一个公共接受者 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>。这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 已经接受了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，所以当它响应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 Prepare 时，必然把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>(连同编号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>)回报给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的提议者。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的提议者在阶段二就看到了「已有接受者接受过值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>」，根据上一节那条规则，它被迫选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>(或某个编号更高但同样追溯到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的值)作为提交值:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mtext> 在 </mtext><mi>n</mi><mtext> 被选定</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> 提案 </mtext><msup><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext> 的值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v \\text{ 在 } n \\text{ 被选定} \\implies \\forall n&#x27; &gt; n,\\ \\text{提案 } n&#x27; \\text{ 的值} = v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">被选定</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.841em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9963em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">提案</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用数学归纳法把它推广到所有更高编号，就得到完整结论：一旦一个值被选定，所有后续提案都只会提交同一个值，协定性成立。注意这个论证不依赖任何时间假设、不在乎消息延迟多久、不在乎谁先崩溃——它纯粹靠多数派交集和那条提交规则。这正是为什么 Paxos 的安全性如此稳固，也是它绕过 <a href=\"../foundations/fault-models-flp\">FLP</a> 时只牺牲活性、绝不牺牲安全的根源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"活性-活锁与-flp-的影子\">活性、活锁与 FLP 的影子</h2><p>Paxos 的安全性是无条件的，但终止性(活性)不是——这恰好印证了 <a href=\"../foundations/fault-models-flp\">FLP</a>。最典型的麻烦是「活锁」：两个提议者交替抬高编号互相压制。提议者 A 用编号 1 完成阶段一，正要进阶段二时，提议者 B 用编号 2 完成阶段一，把接受者的承诺抬到 2，于是 A 的阶段二被拒；A 不甘心用编号 3 重来，又把 B 的阶段二顶掉……如此循环，谁都提交不了，系统空转。</p>\n<p>工程上的标准解法是「选一个稳定领导者」：让单个提议者长期独占提议权，其它进程不主动发起新编号，活锁自然消失。这并不违反安全性——领导者的存在纯粹是为活性服务的优化，即便选出了两个「领导者」也只是退化回活锁、不会破坏协定。把这个「稳定领导者 + 把单值扩展成日志」的思路系统化，就是下一篇 <a href=\"multi-paxos\">Multi-Paxos</a> 的全部内容，它也是理解 Raft 的桥梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>基本 Paxos 解决单值共识：三角色(提议者/接受者/学习者)、两阶段(Prepare/Accept)，目标是只选定一个不可推翻的值。</li>\n<li>提案编号全局唯一且单调，给并发提案排全序；接受者「只听更高编号」，编号是动态的隐式优先级。</li>\n<li>安全性核心是阶段二的提交规则——必须沿用阶段一收回的最高编号已接受值；配合多数派交集，保证「一旦选定，所有后续提案提交同一值」。</li>\n<li>多数派交集论证不依赖任何时间假设，这是 Paxos 安全性稳固、且绕过 FLP 时只牺牲活性的根源。</li>\n<li>活性会被活锁破坏(两提议者互相抬编号)，工程上用稳定领导者解决——这引出 Multi-Paxos。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"multi-paxos\">Multi-Paxos</a> — 用稳定领导者消除活锁，并把单值共识扩展成连续日志。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/consensus-problem\">共识问题</a> — 多数派相交性质的来源，本篇安全性论证的前提。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../distributed-systems/consensus-protocols/paxos\">Paxos</a> — 从分布式系统全景视角对 Paxos 的概览定位。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基本 Paxos","id":"基本-paxos"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"提案编号：全局唯一且单调","id":"提案编号-全局唯一且单调"},{"level":2,"text":"两阶段的精确语义","id":"两阶段的精确语义"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么只会选出一个值：多数派交集论证","id":"为什么只会选出一个值-多数派交集论证"},{"level":2,"text":"活性、活锁与 FLP 的影子","id":"活性-活锁与-flp-的影子"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"复制状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consensus-algorithms-raft-paxos/foundations/replicated-state-machines"},"next":{"title":"Multi-Paxos 多实例共识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consensus-algorithms-raft-paxos/paxos/multi-paxos"}}